le others are versatile. Check the gender classification on each name card and explore the full collection to find options that match your preferences.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the meaning behind English language names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"{originLabel} names are rooted in rich linguistic traditions spanning centuries. Their meanings often reflect nature, spirituality, virtues, or aspirations. Understanding the original meaning helps parents connect more deeply with their chosen name's significance.\"}}]}24:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50 via-white to-emerald-50\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CollectionPage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hindu Baby Names from English Origin\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A curated collection of Hindu baby names of English origin, each with authentic meanings, cultural significance, and lucky numbers.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://nameverse.site/names/hindu/origin/english/1\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://nameverse.site\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hindu Names\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://nameverse.site/names/hindu\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Origins\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://nameverse.site/names/hindu/origin/arabic/1\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":4,\\\"name\\\":\\\"English Origin\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://nameverse.site/names/hindu/origin/english/1\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"appli